=============================
Git Branching and Merging Exercise
=============================

Step 1: Open Existing Repository

cd GitDemo


=============================
Branching
=============================

1. Create a New Branch

git branch GitNewBranch


2. List All Local Branches

git branch


3. List All Local and Remote Branches

git branch -a


4. Switch to New Branch

git checkout GitNewBranch


5. Create a New File

echo "This is a new branch file" > branch.txt


6. Add File to Staging Area

git add branch.txt


7. Commit Changes

git commit -m "Added branch.txt in GitNewBranch"


8. Check Repository Status

git status


=============================
Merging
=============================

1. Switch to Master Branch

git checkout master


2. Compare Master and Branch

git diff master GitNewBranch


3. View Visual Difference Using P4Merge

git difftool master GitNewBranch


4. Merge Branch into Master

git merge GitNewBranch


5. View Commit History

git log --oneline --graph --decorate


6. Delete the Merged Branch

git branch -d GitNewBranch


7. Verify Repository Status

git status
